"group"><div class="ecom-core ecom-group core__block ecom-031rdmvlfk3k"> <div class="core__group--wrapper ecom-accordion__wrapper ecom-flex ecom-column ecom-w__full ecom__element ecom__accordion" data-r="" style=""><div class="core__group--items"><div id="ecom-0le24n5zxqho" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item ecom-item-active" data-id="ecom-0le24n5zxqho"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items ecom-item-active"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">1. How long does it take to inflate the mattress?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-y1iivinylg" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Our built-in pump inflates the mattress in just 3-5 minutes.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-x7yqe8kwhj" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-x7yqe8kwhj"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">2. Is the mattress suitable for outdoor use?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-yqq9asmacon" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Air mattresses are generally suitable for outdoor use, as they are designed to be portable and often come with features that make them resistant to outdoor conditions like moisture and dirt. </div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-u9887ejbef8" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-u9887ejbef8"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">3. What are the dimensions of the mattress?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-x7u6z1qnxzf" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">The dimensions of mattresses can vary widely depending on the type and brand. Common sizes for mattresses include:<div><br><div>&nbsp;- Twin: 38 inches wide by 75 inches long</div><div>&nbsp;- Full (Double): 54 inches wide by 75 inches long</div><div>&nbsp;- Queen: 60 inches wide by 80 inches long</div><div>&nbsp;- King: 76 inches wide by 80 inches long</div><div><br></div><div>There are also variations in thickness, with mattresses typically ranging from 6 to 14 inches deep.
</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-1tugw3pqm2x" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-1tugw3pqm2x"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">4. How do I clean the mattress?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-fvm20ym35v9" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">To clean the mattress:<div><br></div><div>&nbsp;1. Vacuum the mattress to remove dust and debris using an upholstery attachment.</div><div>&nbsp;2. Spot clean stains with a mild detergent diluted in water, using a soft cloth or sponge. Avoid soaking the mattress.</div><div>&nbsp;3. Sprinkle baking soda over the mattress surface to absorb odors. Let it sit for several hours or overnight, then vacuum thoroughly.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Always follow specific care instructions from the manufacturer to avoid damaging the mattress.</div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-l05ub7g85vp" data-id="ecom-l05ub7g85vp" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--first core__column--last ecom-39n5mlzqiq6"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-ymmdct3f4" data-core-is="row"><div class="ecom-row ecom-core core__block ecom-m5brc6zdsvp" data-id="ecom-m5brc6zdsvp" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="2" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--first ecom-iur6ibhy0wm"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-kmt4of125xp" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="2"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><strong>Stay Updated &amp; Sleep Better&nbsp;</strong><div>Join Our Sleep Community</div></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-t2ybio2k8qm" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Sign up for our newsletter to receive exclusive deals, sleep tips,&nbsp;<div>and the latest product updates.</div></div></div></div> <div clas